{"availability":"available","full":"tsotsoobi/gyema-app-mainnet","name":"gyema-app-mainnet","description":"Gyema on Pi Mainnet — production deployment of P2P delivery platform","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-26T07:53:26Z","updated":"2026-10-08T15:20:52Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://gyema-app-mainnet.vercel.app","topics":["ghana","logistics","nextjs","pi-network","supabase"],"demo":"https://gyema-app-mainnet.vercel.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:48.293Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:48.293Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T23:43:48.293Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T23:43:48.293Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Peer-to-peer delivery on Pi Network, built in Ghana for the world.","Gyema connects two sides of every delivery: Senders with packages to move, and Travellers already making the trip. Pi is the payment rail. This is the Mainnet app, live on Pi Mainnet and served in Pi Browser via gyema8841.pinet.com. The Testnet repo (tsotsoobi/gyema-app) is the identical-code staging mirror.","Pi Testnet rotates piuid values across sessions for the same Pioneer (0.16% rate observed at production scale). piusername is the stable identity anchor. findOrCreatePioneerUser resolves identity in three tiers: indexed lookup on piusername (primary), indexed lookup on piuid (legacy compat), then a listUsers fallback that defends against schema drift. The function returns the canonical piuid stored in the Pioneer row, which generatePioneerSession must use — passing the rotated session-time uid would authenticate against the wrong auth.users record."],"features":["Production: gyema-app-mainnet.vercel.app, in Pi Browser at gyema8841.pinet.com","V2 escrow contracts: tsotsoobi/gyema-contracts","Company: Pi Logistics Ltd."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/tsotsoobi/gyema-app-mainnet/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint"